        "text": "**Chapter 1: What is Linux**\n\nWelcome along to the Ultimate Linux Newbie Guide! In this chapter we cover the essentials\nincluding: What an Operating System is, What UNIX is and how Linux differs from UNIX.\n\n**Table of Contents**\n\n  - [Linux, By Defnition:i](https://linuxnewbieguide.org/overview-of-chapters/chapter-1-what-is-linux/#Linux_By_Definition)\n\n  - [What\u2019s An Operating System?](https://linuxnewbieguide.org/overview-of-chapters/chapter-1-what-is-linux/#Whats_An_Operating_System)\n\n  - [What is UNIX? (And a little bit of history)](https://linuxnewbieguide.org/overview-of-chapters/chapter-1-what-is-linux/#What_is_UNIX_And_a_little_bit_of_history)\n\n`o` [UNIX History Timeline](https://linuxnewbieguide.org/overview-of-chapters/chapter-1-what-is-linux/#UNIX_History_Timeline)\n\n`o` [Pony Up](https://linuxnewbieguide.org/overview-of-chapters/chapter-1-what-is-linux/#Pony_Up)\n\n`o` [Why don\u2019t we all use UNIX today if it\u2019s so good?](https://linuxnewbieguide.org/overview-of-chapters/chapter-1-what-is-linux/#Why_dont_we_all_use_UNIX_today_if_its_so_good)\n\n  - [How does Linux differ from UNIX?](https://linuxnewbieguide.org/overview-of-chapters/chapter-1-what-is-linux/#How_does_Linux_differ_from_UNIX)\n\n`o` [The Free Software Foundation and the GPL](https://linuxnewbieguide.org/overview-of-chapters/chapter-1-what-is-linux/#The_Free_Software_Foundation_and_the_GPL)\n\n\n-----",
